    "detailed_description": "In Void Bound, a fast-paced multiplayer game, you and your team of elite demon hunters face never-ending waves of demonic creatures from other dimensions. The goal is to survive each round using unique weapons and abilities from a roster of three characters. Work together with your friends to fend off powerful and terrifying creatures and progress through intense, wave-based rounds. How long can you survive the onslaught?<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fluid and fast-paced movement <br></li><li> Choose between 3 unique characters and play styles<br></li><li> Survive with friends against demonic hordes<br></li><li> Intense wave-based survival gameplay<br></li><li> Unique weapons and abilities to master<br></li><li> Challenging rounds that increase in difficulty<br></li><li> Non-stop heart-pounding action</li></ul>",
